# The exact denial each hostile variant must produce: five documents, five
# denials, one field each. A message that disappears is a relaxed reconciler
# rule, and the reviewed artifact beside this file is the positive control.
Kustomization obsync-reconciler must not prune during the direct release boundary
Kustomization obsync-reconciler must orphan inventory on deletion
Kustomization obsync-reconciler must use path ./kubernetes/websites/obsync
Kustomization obsync-reconciler must use ServiceAccount obsync-reconciler
Kustomization obsync-reconciler must wait for runtime readiness
